;====================<WINQUOTES>====================
[Quotes]
victory0 = "You don't want to keep losing, right? I'll accept a rematch anytime!"
victory1 = "If this is a world championship, I think the bar for qualification should be raised!"
victory2 = "If you've got time to feel sorry for yourself, you've got time to get stronger!"
victory3 = "It's been a while since a fight's got my blood pumping like this!"
victory4 = "This is the strength of the Hungry Wolf. Do you understand?"
victory5 = "You'd never make it in South Town with those skills!"
victory6 = "Phew! That was pretty thrilling!"
victory7 = "That's the best you can do? Maybe consider the skill level of your opponent before you challenge them!"

;Terry Bogard
victory8 = "Couldn't copy the spirit, huh? You look just like me, though!"

;Andy Bogard
victory9 = "Your speed and skill are on point! Still not gonna just let you win, though!"

;Joe Higashi
victory10 = "Hey Joe, you're not holding back, are you? Always go all out. That's the rule!"

;Geese Howard
victory11 = "You're up to something, aren't you? I won't give you a free pass to do whatever you want!"

;Rock Howard
victory12 = "Go ahead, throw everything you've got at me! Then we'll talk about the future!"

;A.K.I.
victory13 = "Man, an assassin that uses poison? Really, get away from me, ugh."

;Alice Garnet Nakata 
victory14 = "You fought way longer than I thought you would, Alice! I'm looking forward to next time!"

;Ash Crimson
victory15 = "Sorry, kid! Looks like I got too serious! If you don't like it, you can always try and challenge me again!"

;Evil Ash
victory16 = "You 'rule time', yet you lost to me? That power was all in your mind."

;Athena Asamiya
victory17 = "Sorry, I don't want to get on your bad side. I just wanted to show you that my fangs are still sharp."

;Balrog (Claw)
victory18 = "Fangs should be bared when needed. You don't wanna leave em' out."

;Benimaru Nikaido
victory19 = "You'd better have the luck to match that big mouth of yours!"

;Billy Kane
victory20 = "You're not the type to hang your tail between your legs, are you, Billy? Get up already!"

;M. Bison (Boxer)	
victory21 = "You're not fit to be a champ! You're blinded by greed!"

;Blanka
victory22 = "Rather than wilderness, it's just your nature, you know!"

;Cammy White
victory23 = "Calculation alone can't keep Terry down. It's all about the emotion in your fists!"

;Chang Koehan / Choi Bounge
victory24 = "Just how long have you two been getting away with this? Kim's got a lot of work to do."

;Chun-Li
victory25 = "I've fought Chinese Martial Arts many times before, it still amazes me how deep its knowledge goes!"

;Clark Still
victory26 = "Sorry, but today I just can't be beat! It'll be a straight shot to victory for me!"

;Goro Daimon
victory27 = "I'm down for a rematch anytime! Hell, I wouldn't mind going at it again right now. How about it?"

;Duo Lon
victory28 = "You just let your guard down there. You didn't think you could beat me like that, did ya?"

;Dan Hibiki
victory29 = "Sorry pal, but you don't have the luck or skills to be a star."

;Dhalsim
victory30 = "Hey, hey... That's one hell of a dislocation! That's not gonna get better anytime soon, is it?"

;Dee Jay
victory31 = "I like my music a bit more mellow, but what you're playing isn't bad at all!"

;Dolores
victory32 = "Liquid, solid... That mud is bigger trouble than I thought. The more I know!"

;Duck King
victory33 = "You've been out of the game for too long. I'm sorry, but I'm eons ahead of you."

;Eagle
victory34 = "Did you wanna play a game with that baton? Against a wolf, that's a deadly game."

;Ed
victory35 = "You're reckless and rash, to put it bluntly. But that's what it means to be young."

;Elisabeth Blanctorche 
victory36 = "I don't know what's your problem, but just worrying won't help! Why don't you try taking a chance?"

;Gouki
victory37 = "You're like a demon. Just looking at you gave me the shakes."

;Shin Gouki
victory38 = "So, you're no longer human. There's a nasty piece of work."

;Guile
victory39 = "Martial Arts have come a long way. Try and catch up with me!"

;Hibiki Takane
victory40 = "Your eyes are the eyes of a fighter. Fight with confidence!"

;Haohmaru
victory41 = "A clash of fists and swords. Not a bad idea. I had a blast!"

;E. Honda
victory42 = "So that's 'Sumo', huh. Powerful & Mysterious!"

;Hwa Jai
victory43 = "Your Muay Thai is a lot different from Joe's... I had fun with you though!"

;Iori Yagami
victory44 = "I can't say that I don't hate people nowadays. I'll just fight like a wolf... and let my heart howl!"

;Orochi Iori
victory45 = "A wolf can't be killed by a rabid dog!"

;Isla
victory46 = "Everybody in South Town heard of you, graffiti girl. Hope everything works out for you!"

;Jamie Siu
victory47 = "So that's drunken fist kung-fu. Neat. I'll have you know my style has its roots in China too."

;B. Jenet
victory48 = "I'm not the kinda guy who can appeal to the fans during a fight. Talk soon, okay?"

;JP
victory49 = "No matter where I go, there's always someone looking to spoil the party."

;Juri Han
victory50 = "Hey, calm down a bit would you? No need to give me that crazy eye."

;K'
victory51 = "Wanna go into overtime, buddy? Your fists are telling me you haven't admitted defeat yet!"

;Mr. Karate
victory52 = "Wait, has Jeff fought you before? That means... I sort of got to fight him through you."

;Ken Masters
victory53 = "This burning fist is the real deal! Make sure to burn it into your heart!"

;Sie Kensou
victory54 = "Maybe you should go on a journey. Traveling may give you some experience."

;Kim Kaphwan
victory55 = "You're still flying, Kim! It's not missionary work... Uh, how's the rehabiliation going?"

;Kimberly Jackson
victory56 = "Your ninja stuff is pretty colorful. Is that a trend or something?"

;King
victory57 = "Either stand up, or run off with your tail between your legs. Ask your soul!"

;Kula Diamond
victory58 = "Uh oh, you okay, little miss? I'll make it up to you by buying you something tasty at Richard's place."

;Kyo Kusanagi
victory59 = "Sorry Kyo, but this win is mine. The wolf in me still wants to run wild!"

;Kyosuke Kagami
victory60 = "That's the Southtown Style welcome for you. Come again anytime, I'm always ready!"

;Leona Heidern
victory61 = "What? You're giving up already? In South Town, this is just how we say 'hello'!"

;Luke Sullivan
victory62 = "The young blood keep on coming. But I'm not ready to retire just yet."

;Luong
victory63 = "Your taekwondo's got a unique flavor — different from Kim's. That was a blast!"

;Mai Shiranui
victory64 = "I'm telling you! I don't know anything about Andy!"

;Maki Genryusai	
victory65 = "It was an all-out attack. What a fresh battle!"

;Manon Legrand
victory66 = "For a ballerina, you sure do go crazy with your moves, huh? Hahaha!"

;Marisa Rossetti
victory67 = "Now that was fun! I love when my opponent puts all their strength into a fight!"

;Blue Mary
victory68 = "Hope that helped refresh you! You work too hard. Let's go grab some drinks!"

;Mature
victory69 = "My dad always told me to watch out for women like you. So I'll be going now."

;Maxima
victory70 = "That was a great fight! I always welcome heated matches like that anytime!"

;Meitenkun
victory71 = "You always sleep when you train? Next time I drop by, let's spar!"

;Morrigan Aensland
victory72 = "If this wasn't a fighting tournament, I'd have taken you up on your little offer."

;Nakoruru
victory73 = "I'm all for preserving nature... But you're not gonna get anywhere just being nice!"

;Oswald
victory74 = "No priority seat for you, old man! You are one tough old geezer!"

;Raiden
victory75 = "Hey, it's been a while. You've gotten stronger and bigger, haven't you?"

;Ralf Jones
victory76 = "I was raised on the streets, so I'm used to fighting tough guys, even if I'm taking on the army!"

;Rashid
victory77 = "Letting the wind do your fighting is unique. I let it tell me where I'm heading next."

;Robert Garcia
victory78 = "Hey! You okay with losing all the time, handsome? If you don't like that, then come and get me!"

;Rolento F. Schugerg
victory79 = "If you're scouting for mercenaries, I'll pass. I don't like giving orders, and I don't like taking them."

;Rugal Bernstein
victory80 = "It's a bit of a scam to call yourself a master class fighter when you're only that good."

;God Rugal
victory81 = "Beating you doesn't make me feel like I've surpassed God."

;Ryo Sakazaki
victory82 = "Kyokugen's limits aren't an easy thing to reach. Isn't that right, Ryo?"

;Ryu
victory83 = "That was a great fight. Let's fight again sometime!"

;Evil Ryu
victory84 = "You went out with a bang. I'm a little hot under the collar...!"

;Sagat
victory85 = "I've misunderstood Muay Thai until now. I know a guy who's not so serious."

;Sakura Kasugano
victory86 = "I'm so happy! Not just cute, but strong to boot!"

;Shen Woo
victory87 = "If you don't like being on the floor, stand up! That's how I grew stronger!"

;Shun'ei
victory88 = "I won't lose so easily, junior! I shouldn't talk, but you need to train properly!"

;Ryuhaku Todoh
victory89 = "The spirit of ancient martial arts... Nice! I felt your commitment to the fight loud and clear!"

;Vanessa
victory90 = "A great rush, but your punches are too light!"

;Vega (Dictator)
victory91 = "You're one of them, aren't you? Then, I'll never forgive you!"

;Shin Vega (Dictator)
victory92 = "Who flubbed the spreadsheet formula to get this mess!?"

;Vice
victory93 = "I'm still alive and kicking. I don't appreciate your rough treatment!"

;Whip
victory94 = "You can whip a lion into submission, but you can never tame a wolf like me!"

;Ryuji Yamazaki
victory95 = "Tch. Compared to you, a rattlesnake's like a puppy."

;Yang Lee/Yun Lee
victory96 = "Power and logic are nothing without spirit!"

;Yashiro Nanakase
victory97 = "I'm totally up for fighting you, but only if you're playing legit."

;Yuri Sakazaki
victory98 = "I'm all for having fun while fighting, but this tournament's all about the nail-biting tension!"

;Zangief
victory99 = "Sorry about that! Red and Stars are my lucky symbols!"